---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { registry } from '../lib/content-registry';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About | ${registry.site.title}`} description="About the Deep Knowledge Base and its content model.">
  <section class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">A structured learning journal.</h1>
    <div class="mt-5 prose max-w-none text-slate-700 dark:prose-invert dark:text-slate-200">
      <p>
        This knowledge base is designed for practical, enduring learning. It brings together notes on software engineering, machine learning, web development, and the core mathematical ideas that inform modern systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        The content is intentionally file-based and versioned, making it easy to add new categories, topics, and lessons without needing to rewrite the application.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Searchable static documentation</li>
        <li>JSON-driven content architecture</li>
        <li>Responsive, accessible reading experience</li>
        <li>Content validation before publishing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
